      "text": "2.1.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4486694335938,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Early detection and treatment for TB among people living with HIV is crucial for reducing morbidity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4334106445312,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "and mortality. TB screening tools are designed to distinguish people with a higher probability of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4310302734375,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "having TB disease, from those with a lower probability. Screening tests need to be followed by a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.4212646484375,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic test, offered as part of a comprehensive clinical evaluation, to confirm or rule out TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.3851318359375,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "disease  . WHO recommends that people living with HIV are systematically screened for TB disease  (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
